export const PLANET_IN_SIGN: Record<string, string> = {
  // ── SUN ──
  'SUN_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and the Sun is exalted here ... identity runs on initiative and the nerve to move first. Vitality climbs when there is a thing to start, a challenge to meet head on, a front to lead from. The presence is direct and genuinely magnetic in motion, hard to ignore and rarely trying to be. The shadow is impulse outrunning aim ... a self that burns bright and brief unless it learns to follow a thing past the thrill of beginning it.`,

  'SUN_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and the Sun settles in for the long haul ... identity is built slowly, deliberately, and made to last. The core self steadies a room simply by not rushing, finding its vitality in what is solid, sensory, and genuinely owned. There is patience here that outlasts flashier types. The shadow is the same steadiness gone stubborn ... a self that mistakes refusing to move for strength, and digs in long after the ground has shifted underneath it.`,

  'SUN_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and the Sun shines through curiosity ... identity is a moving thing, alive in conversation, questions, and the next interesting idea. Vitality runs on variety and exchange, on the quick connections a restless mind keeps drawing between scattered things. The presence is bright, verbal, easy to like. The shadow is dispersal ... a self spread thin across a dozen half finished interests, brilliant in the moment and harder to locate underneath all the versions it tries on.`,

  'SUN_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and the Sun shines through feeling ... identity is built around care, memory, and the people and places that count as home. Vitality rises and falls with the emotional tide, drawing strength from belonging and giving it back as warmth. The presence is gentle but quietly protective. The shadow is the shell ... a self that guards the soft center so carefully it can confuse being needed with being known, and retreats inward when it most needs contact.`,

  'SUN_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and the Sun rules here, fully at home ... identity is meant to be expressed, warmly and out loud, and the room tends to notice. Vitality runs on creativity, play, and the generous heat of attention given and returned. The presence carries a natural pride that mostly earns the gaze it draws. The shadow is the gap between the warmth that shines because it is its nature and the version that needs the room watching to feel real.`,

  'SUN_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and the Sun shines through usefulness ... identity is built on craft, discernment, and the quiet satisfaction of doing a thing well. Vitality comes from improving the work, tending the body, being genuinely good at something concrete. The presence understates how capable it actually is. The shadow is the inner critic turned on the self ... a core identity that can forget it is allowed to simply exist, worthy before it has been useful, whole before it has been fixed.`,

  'SUN_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and the Sun shines through relationship ... identity takes shape in the space between people, in balance, fairness, and the art of meeting another halfway. Vitality comes from harmony genuinely offered and beauty actually made. The presence is poised, diplomatic, easy to be around. The shadow is a self defined too much by the other ... a core identity that can sand its own edges down so smoothly it loses track of what it wants when no one else is in the room.`,

  'SUN_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and the Sun shines through depth ... identity forms around intensity, privacy, and the will to face what others look away from. Vitality runs on emotional truth and the slow power of transformation, the capacity to die to an old self and come back changed. The presence withholds, and is magnetic for it. The shadow is control ... a self that can armor so completely it keeps out the very closeness it most wants, mistaking the guard for the strength underneath it.`,

  'SUN_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and the Sun shines through the search ... identity is built around meaning, freedom, and the horizon that is always a little further on. Vitality comes from learning, wandering, and the conviction that life is bigger than the room it is currently in. The presence is frank, warm, contagiously optimistic. The shadow is restlessness ... a self forever reaching past the thing in front of it, that can mistake the next horizon for arrival and forget to stay long enough to be known.`,

  'SUN_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and the Sun shines through purpose ... identity is built on responsibility, mastery, and something real being constructed over years. Vitality comes from discipline and the slow accumulation of standing actually earned. The presence carries authority without asking for it, and others lean on it. The shadow is the self that becomes a structure ... a core identity so managed and load bearing it forgets it is allowed to be a person, warm and unfinished, and not only a thing that holds.`,

  'SUN_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and the Sun shines through difference ... identity runs on independence, ideas, and a private frequency the crowd does not quite share. Vitality comes from the bigger picture, the principle, the future it can already half see. The presence is original and engaged, friendly at a cool distance. The shadow is detachment ... a self that can observe its own life from a step back, so committed to the collective or the concept that the warm particular person underneath gets held at arm's length.`,

  'SUN_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and the Sun shines through dissolution ... identity is permeable, intuitive, tuned to a current larger than itself. Vitality comes from imagination, compassion, and a faith that does not need everything proven. The presence is gentle, dreamlike, hard to pin because it keeps shifting to match what surrounds it. The shadow is the missing edge ... a self that can absorb so much of the room it loses its own outline, and has to keep finding the person behind all that lovely receptivity.`,


  // ── MOON ──
  'MOON_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and the Moon feels fast and hot ... emotion arrives at full volume and wants out immediately, no waiting for the right moment. Safety comes through action, through doing something with the feeling rather than sitting in it. The instinct is direct, honest, quick to flare and quick to cool. The shadow is impatience with the inner life ... a heart that can fire off a reaction before it has felt what it actually feels, and has to learn that some emotions only reveal themselves slowly.`,

  'MOON_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and the Moon is exalted here, fully soothed ... emotion runs steady, slow, and deeply sensory, hard to rattle once settled. Safety comes through comfort, routine, and the physical world being reliably in place. The instinct is calm and grounding, a presence that steadies the people nearby. The shadow is the same steadiness gone immovable ... a heart that can cling to a comfort or a grudge past all use, mistaking the refusal to feel change for genuine peace.`,

  'MOON_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and the Moon feels through words ... emotion gets processed by naming it, talking it out, turning it over from a few different angles. Safety comes through conversation and mental variety, through not being stuck in one mood for long. The instinct is curious, light, quick to reframe. The shadow is the talk that outruns the feeling ... a heart that can narrate an emotion fluently while keeping it at arm's length, and has to learn to actually sit in what it is so neatly describing.`,

  'MOON_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and the Moon rules here, completely at home ... emotion is the native language, deep and tidal and finely tuned to everyone in the room. Safety comes through home, family, and the felt sense of belonging somewhere. The instinct is nurturing, protective, with a long memory for how things felt. The shadow is the shell ... a heart so good at caring for others and guarding its own soft center that it can confuse being needed with being known, and retreat inward exactly when it needs contact.`,

  'MOON_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and the Moon feels warmly and out loud ... emotion is generous, dramatic, and wants to be witnessed rather than hidden. Safety comes through affection, recognition, and the warmth of being genuinely appreciated. The instinct is big hearted and loyal, quick to give and quick to glow. The shadow is the need for the audience ... a heart that can tie its wellbeing to being seen, and has to learn that the warmth is real whether or not anyone is currently clapping for it.`,

  'MOON_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and the Moon feels by tidying ... emotion gets managed through order, usefulness, and quietly fixing whatever is in reach. Safety comes through routine, competence, and being genuinely helpful to someone. The instinct is attentive, modest, alert to what needs doing. The shadow is the critic turned inward ... a heart that can pick its own feelings apart looking for the flaw, and has to learn that not every emotion is a problem to solve, that some just need to be felt and left alone.`,

  'MOON_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and the Moon feels through harmony ... emotional safety depends on the peace between people being intact, on no one in the room at odds. The instinct is gracious, accommodating, finely attuned to the mood of others. Comfort comes through partnership and beauty and fairness genuinely kept. The shadow is the self that vanishes into the keeping of peace ... a heart so set on avoiding conflict it can lose track of its own feeling, agreeing its way out of knowing what it actually wants.`,

  'MOON_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and the Moon is in its fall here ... emotion runs deeper and more intense than it can easily show, all or nothing, with nothing held lightly. Safety comes through trust earned slowly and a privacy fiercely kept. The instinct is penetrating, loyal, and quietly powerful. The shadow is the pressure of so much unshown feeling ... a heart that can brood, suspect, and hold on past all reason, and has to learn that letting another in is the risk that actually relieves the depth instead of guarding it.`,

  'MOON_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and the Moon feels best with room ... emotional safety depends on freedom, space, and a horizon to aim at. The instinct is warm, buoyant, allergic to being fenced in. Comfort comes through movement, meaning, and the faith that things tend to work out. The shadow is the bolt toward the exit ... a heart that can mistake restlessness for happiness and leave the moment a feeling gets heavy, learning slowly that staying through the difficult patch is its own kind of freedom.`,

  'MOON_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and the Moon is in its detriment here ... emotion is held under tight management, kept private, handled rather than felt out loud. Safety comes through competence, control, and a self that does not need anyone. The instinct is reserved, dutiful, slow to show the soft side. The shadow is the guard that never comes down ... a heart that learned early to armor up and call it strength, and has to discover that being held is not the same as being weak.`,

  'MOON_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and the Moon feels at a cool distance ... emotion gets processed through ideas and observation, kept a step back from the heat of it. Safety comes through space, independence, and belonging to something wider than one close bond. The instinct is friendly but detached, warmer toward humanity than toward intimacy. The shadow is the step back that becomes a wall ... a heart that can analyze its own feelings from across the room, and has to learn to come close enough to actually be touched by them.`,

  'MOON_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and the Moon feels everything ... emotion is oceanic and permeable, picking up the mood of a room before a word is said. Safety comes through retreat, imagination, and a sense of connection to something larger. The instinct is gentle, compassionate, boundless. The shadow is the missing membrane ... a heart that can absorb so much of everyone else it loses its own feeling in the mix, and has to keep finding which of the emotions in the room are actually its own.`,


  // ── MERCURY ──
  'MERCURY_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and Mercury thinks at a sprint ... ideas arrive already decided, and the instinct is to say the thing before the room has finished the question. Speech is direct, competitive, allergic to hedging. The mind is sharpest at the moment of engagement, not after long deliberation. The shadow is speed mistaken for clarity ... a quickness that can fire off the first thought as if it were the final one, and grows by learning that one deliberate pause sharpens an already sharp instinct.`,

  'MERCURY_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and Mercury thinks slowly and for keeps ... ideas are chewed over, tested against the concrete, and not adopted until they hold weight. Speech is measured, plain, reluctant to be rushed. Once an opinion is set it tends to stay set. The mind trusts what it can touch over what merely sounds clever. The shadow is the same solidity gone rigid ... a thinking that can plant itself so firmly it will not be moved by a better argument, mistaking stubbornness for conviction.`,

  'MERCURY_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and Mercury rules here, fully in its element ... the mind is quick, fluent, endlessly curious, drawing fast connections between things that do not obviously belong together. Speech is witty and versatile, at ease in any register. There is a real gift for language and pattern. The shadow is the half finished thought ... a mind that generates more ideas than it ever completes, brilliant in the spark and thinner in the follow through, learning slowly to take one thread all the way down.`,

  'MERCURY_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and Mercury thinks through feeling ... ideas come wrapped in mood and memory, and the mind reasons from what something feels like as much as what it is. Speech is gentle, indirect, attuned to how words will land. Recall for the emotional texture of things runs deep. The shadow is the personal taken for the logical ... a mind that can mistake a feeling for a fact and struggle to separate what is true from what simply hurts or comforts.`,

  'MERCURY_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and Mercury thinks with flair ... ideas come out warm, confident, and meant to be heard, delivered with the whole personality behind them. Speech is expressive, persuasive, a little theatrical. The mind enjoys an audience and usually wins one. The shadow is the ego in the argument ... a thinking that can defend a position because it is theirs rather than because it is right, learning that the strongest mind can change itself in public without losing any standing.`,

  'MERCURY_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and Mercury rules and is exalted here, at its sharpest ... the mind is precise, analytical, and gifted at seeing the detail everyone else skims past. Speech is exact, useful, carefully chosen. Few placements parse a problem as cleanly. The shadow is the critic that cannot rest ... a mind so tuned to the flaw that it can pick a thing apart endlessly, mistaking criticism for thoroughness, and grows by trusting that good enough is sometimes precisely enough.`,

  'MERCURY_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and Mercury thinks in pairs ... every idea gets weighed against its opposite, and the mind reasons by comparison, fairness, and the view from both sides. Speech is diplomatic, balanced, easy to agree with. There is real talent for seeing what the other position gets right. The shadow is the verdict that never comes ... a mind that can balance the options so evenly it cannot land on one, mistaking endless weighing for genuine fairness.`,

  'MERCURY_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and Mercury thinks beneath the surface ... the mind distrusts the obvious answer and digs for the motive, the secret, the thing not being said. Speech is deliberate, probing, often withheld until it has the full picture. Few placements investigate as relentlessly. The shadow is suspicion as a default ... a mind that can read hidden agendas into plain situations and brood on them, learning that not every surface is a lie waiting to be exposed.`,

  'MERCURY_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and Mercury sits in its detriment here ... the mind grasps the big picture instantly and loses patience with the fine print. Speech is frank, expansive, fond of the sweeping claim. The instinct is for meaning over mechanism, the forest over the trees. The shadow is the detail left behind ... a thinking that can be right about the whole and careless about the parts, overstating to make the point, and grows by slowing down enough to check the specifics it would rather skip.`,

  'MERCURY_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and Mercury thinks in structures ... ideas are organized, strategic, and aimed at something that will actually stand. Speech is economical, serious, slow to waste a word. The mind plans in long arcs and rarely loses the thread. The shadow is the imagination kept on a short leash ... a thinking so practical it can dismiss the idea that has not proven itself yet, learning that not every useful thought arrives already wearing a suit.`,

  'MERCURY_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and Mercury thinks in systems ... the mind runs on patterns, principles, and the odd angle nobody else considered. Speech is original, objective, a little cool. The instinct is to step back and see the whole structure from above. The shadow is the fixed conclusion ... a thinking so sure of its own independence that it can mistake contrarianism for insight, holding an idea because it is unconventional rather than because it is true.`,

  'MERCURY_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and Mercury sits in its detriment and fall here ... the mind works by image, intuition, and impression rather than straight lines, often knowing a thing without being able to say how. Speech is poetic, allusive, sometimes hard to pin. The gift is imaginative and genuinely original. The shadow is the lost thread ... a mind that can drift, blur, and doubt its own clarity, learning to trust the intuition while building enough structure to carry it back to the rest of the world.`,


  // ── VENUS ──
  'VENUS_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and Venus sits in its detriment here ... love arrives as pursuit, fast and direct, more thrilled by the chase than the settling. Attraction is immediate and a little impatient, drawn to nerve and heat. Affection is honest, unsubtle, generous in the moment. The shadow is the spark that fades once won ... a way of loving that can lose interest the instant a thing stops being a conquest, and grows by learning that the deeper pleasure starts after the chase is over.`,

  'VENUS_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and Venus rules here, fully at home ... love is sensory, loyal, and built to last, expressed through touch, comfort, and steady devotion. Beauty is something to be felt and kept, pleasure taken slowly and without apology. Affection runs warm and dependable. The shadow is love turned possessive ... a devotion that can grip a person or a comfort like property, mistaking the holding on for the loving, and learning that what is held too tightly stops being freely given.`,

  'VENUS_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and Venus loves through the mind ... attraction runs on wit, conversation, and the spark of a quick exchange, charmed by anyone genuinely interesting to talk to. Affection is playful, light, curious. Variety keeps the feeling alive. The shadow is the flirtation that never lands ... a way of loving that can stay at the clever surface, sampling connections, and grows by letting one of them go deep enough to become more than a good conversation.`,

  'VENUS_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and Venus loves tenderly ... attraction is bound up with safety, care, and the wish to nurture and be nurtured. Affection is protective, sentimental, with a long memory for how love felt. Home is the truest romance. The shadow is the clinging that fear produces ... a devotion that can hold on out of a need to feel secure, smothering the very closeness it wants, and learning that real care leaves room to breathe.`,

  'VENUS_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and Venus loves grandly ... attraction is warm, dramatic, and generous, drawn to romance done boldly and loyalty worn out loud. Affection is theatrical and wholehearted, happiest when love is celebrated rather than kept quiet. The shadow is the need for the spotlight in the bond ... a way of loving that can require constant admiration to feel secure, and grows by trusting that the warmth is real even on the days no one is performing it back.`,

  'VENUS_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and Venus sits in its fall here ... love shows through service, attention, and the quiet acts of care that say more than declarations do. Affection is modest, useful, a little reserved. Standards run high. The shadow is the critic in the heart ... a way of loving that can pick at the flaws in a partner or withhold itself waiting for a worthiness that never quite arrives, and grows by learning that love was never meant to be earned through perfection.`,

  'VENUS_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and Venus rules here, fully at home ... love is the native art, expressed through harmony, fairness, and the genuine pleasure of meeting another halfway. Attraction is drawn to grace, balance, and beauty. Affection is considerate and easy to receive. The shadow is the self that disappears into the partner ... a way of loving so set on keeping the peace it can lose its own wants, and grows by staying a distinct person inside the harmony it works so hard to keep.`,

  'VENUS_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and Venus sits in its detriment here ... love runs deep, intense, and all or nothing, with nothing about it casual. Attraction is magnetic and total, drawn to what is hidden and hard to reach. Affection is fiercely loyal and fiercely private. The shadow is the grip of so much feeling ... a way of loving that can turn to jealousy, control, and the fear of betrayal, and grows by trusting enough to let the bond breathe instead of guarding it to death.`,

  'VENUS_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and Venus loves freely ... attraction runs on adventure, honesty, and the promise of shared horizons, drawn to anyone who makes the world feel bigger. Affection is warm, frank, allergic to being fenced in. The shadow is the love of the open road over the person on it ... a way of loving that can bolt the moment a bond asks for real commitment, and grows by learning that staying can be its own adventure rather than the end of one.`,

  'VENUS_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and Venus loves seriously ... attraction is slow to kindle and built to endure, drawn to substance, reliability, and a person who is genuinely going somewhere. Affection is understated, loyal, expressed through showing up rather than through flourish. The shadow is the heart kept too guarded ... a way of loving that can treat the bond like a contract and withhold warmth until trust is fully proven, and grows by letting tenderness show before all the evidence is in.`,

  'VENUS_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and Venus loves at a friendly distance ... attraction runs on shared ideas, independence, and a connection that does not demand too much closeness. Affection is loyal but cool, drawn to the unusual and the unconventional. The shadow is the detachment that keeps real intimacy out ... a way of loving that can prize freedom so highly it never quite lets a person all the way in, and grows by allowing the bond to ask something of it.`,

  'VENUS_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and Venus is exalted here, at its most tender ... love is boundless, compassionate, and deeply romantic, dissolving the line between self and other. Attraction is drawn to the soulful, the wounded, the transcendent. Affection gives without keeping score. The shadow is the ideal mistaken for the person ... a way of loving that can fall for the dream of someone and overlook who they actually are, and grows by loving the real one with eyes open.`,


  // ── MARS ──
  'MARS_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and Mars rules here, fully itself ... drive is direct, fast, and immediate, acting on the impulse before second thoughts can slow it. Desire is hot and uncomplicated, the fight met head on. Energy peaks at the moment of attack. The shadow is the act that outruns the aim ... a force that can charge before it has chosen a direction, picking battles for the heat of them, and grows by learning that the strongest move is sometimes the one not made yet.`,

  'MARS_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and Mars sits in its detriment here ... drive is slow to rouse but nearly impossible to stop once moving, expressed through endurance rather than speed. Desire is steady, physical, patient. The fight is a long siege, not a quick strike. The shadow is the same persistence gone immovable ... a force that can keep pushing a thing long past its use simply because stopping feels like losing, and grows by learning when to set the weight down.`,

  'MARS_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and Mars acts through the mind ... drive scatters across many fronts, energetic in words, debate, and quick mental moves. Desire is restless and easily redirected. The fight is fought with the tongue. The shadow is the energy spread too thin ... a force that starts more than it finishes and argues more than it acts, and grows by aiming the restless drive at one target long enough to actually land a blow.`,

  'MARS_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and Mars sits in its fall here ... drive is indirect, tidal, and bound up with feeling, asserting sideways rather than straight on. Desire protects rather than conquers. The fight is defensive, fierce only when home or family is threatened. The shadow is the anger that leaks instead of speaks ... a force that can go passive and moody rather than name what it wants, and grows by learning to assert openly instead of withdrawing and seething.`,

  'MARS_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and Mars acts with pride ... drive is confident, dramatic, and generous, performing its strength rather than hiding it. Desire is warm and wholehearted, the fight fought for honor and the spotlight. Energy is sustained by being seen. The shadow is the ego in the engine ... a force that can burn effort on being admired rather than on the goal, and grows by letting the work matter more than the applause it draws.`,

  'MARS_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and Mars acts with precision ... drive is methodical, efficient, and aimed at doing the thing exactly right. Desire is controlled, channeled into useful work and visible competence. The fight is won by preparation. The shadow is the force turned to fault finding ... an energy that can spend itself criticizing, perfecting, and worrying the details, and grows by letting good work ship before it has been polished into paralysis.`,

  'MARS_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and Mars sits in its detriment here ... drive is filtered through fairness and the wish to keep the peace, slow to push and quick to weigh the other side. Desire hesitates, wanting agreement before action. The fight is avoided where it can be. The shadow is the assertion that never quite arrives ... a force that can stall in the name of balance and resent what it failed to claim, and grows by learning that some things have to be fought for directly.`,

  'MARS_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and Mars rules its traditional home ... drive is intense, strategic, and relentless, moving in silence toward a single deep aim. Desire is total and rarely shown. The fight is patient, controlled, and final when it comes. The shadow is the will that will not release ... a force that can pursue a goal or a grievance long past the productive moment, and grows by learning to tell purposeful endurance from the simple refusal to let go.`,

  'MARS_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and Mars acts on conviction ... drive is enthusiastic, restless, and aimed at the horizon, fighting for belief and the freedom to roam. Desire is adventurous and easily bored. Energy chases the next bigger thing. The shadow is the force that scatters toward every horizon ... an energy that can start grand campaigns and abandon them when the novelty fades, and grows by staying with one quest long enough to see it through.`,

  'MARS_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and Mars is exalted here, at its most effective ... drive is disciplined, strategic, and built for the long climb, spending energy with patience and almost no waste. Desire is ambitious and controlled. The fight is won by outlasting. The shadow is the machine that forgets to rest ... a force so relentlessly aimed at the goal it can grind the self and others down, and grows by remembering the climb was meant to serve a life, not consume it.`,

  'MARS_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and Mars acts on principle ... drive is independent, contrarian, and powered by ideas, fighting for the cause and the future more than for itself. Desire is cool and a little detached. The fight is waged for the collective. The shadow is the rebellion that resists on reflex ... a force that can push against a thing simply because it is expected, and grows by choosing its battles for genuine conviction rather than for the pleasure of not conforming.`,

  'MARS_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and Mars acts indirectly ... drive is diffuse and intuitive, hard to aim in a straight line, moving by feeling and current rather than force. Desire is gentle, easily redirected, sometimes unsure of what it wants. The fight is evasive. The shadow is the energy that drains away unspent ... a force that can dissolve into avoidance or martyrdom rather than act, and grows by giving the formless drive a channel real enough to carry it somewhere.`,


  // ── JUPITER ──
  'JUPITER_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and Jupiter expands through nerve ... growth comes from bold action, from leaping first and trusting the way will appear. Faith runs on self belief and the appetite for a fresh start. Luck favors the one who moves. The shadow is expansion without aim ... an optimism that can launch a dozen ventures on pure enthusiasm and finish none, and grows by pairing the courage to begin with the patience to see one thing through.`,

  'JUPITER_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and Jupiter expands through the tangible ... growth comes slowly and solidly, building abundance that can be touched and kept. Faith rests in the steady accumulation of real things. Luck arrives through patience and good sense. The shadow is expansion turned to excess ... a generous appetite for comfort and plenty that can tip into indulgence and hoarding, and grows by learning that enough, genuinely felt, is its own kind of wealth.`,

  'JUPITER_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and Jupiter sits in its detriment here ... growth comes through ideas and learning, scattered across many subjects rather than deepened in one. Faith is curious and provisional, expanding by collecting. Luck favors the well connected mind. The shadow is the breadth that never becomes depth ... a thinking that can know a little about everything and the whole of nothing, and grows by letting curiosity settle long enough to turn information into genuine understanding.`,

  'JUPITER_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and Jupiter is exalted here, at its most generous ... growth comes through care, home, and the open hearted nurture of others. Faith rests in belonging and the bonds that hold. Luck flows through family and emotional generosity. The shadow is the abundance that smothers ... a warmth that can give past all boundary, mistaking too much care for love, and grows by learning that genuine nurture leaves room for the other to stand on their own.`,

  'JUPITER_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and Jupiter expands through the heart ... growth comes from creativity, play, and generosity worn proudly and out loud. Faith runs on the conviction that life is meant to be enjoyed and shared. Luck favors the warm and the bold. The shadow is the grandeur that overreaches ... an exuberance that can inflate into showing off and excess, and grows by letting the generosity be a gift freely given rather than a performance staged for the applause.`,

  'JUPITER_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and Jupiter sits in its detriment here ... growth comes through the small and the useful rather than the grand, expanding by refining rather than reaching. Faith is modest and earned through good work. Luck favors the diligent. The shadow is the vision lost in the detail ... an instinct that can shrink the big picture into nitpicking and worry, and grows by trusting that the larger meaning is worth lifting the eyes from the fine print to see.`,

  'JUPITER_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and Jupiter expands through relationship ... growth comes through partnership, fairness, and the genuine pleasure of meeting others well. Faith rests in balance and the good that people do together. Luck flows through alliances and grace. The shadow is the expansion that loses itself in pleasing ... a generosity that can over accommodate to keep the peace, and grows by holding its own center while still reaching warmly toward the other.`,

  'JUPITER_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and Jupiter expands through depth ... growth comes from transformation, from facing the hidden and emerging larger. Faith is hard won and rests in the power of renewal. Luck favors the one who is not afraid to dig. The shadow is the intensity that overreaches ... an appetite that can grasp for power and control in the deep places, and grows by trusting that real abundance comes through surrender as much as through will.`,

  'JUPITER_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and Jupiter rules here, fully at home ... growth comes through meaning, travel, and the restless pursuit of a wider truth. Faith is the native element, expansive and contagious. Luck favors the seeker. The shadow is the conviction that hardens into dogma ... an optimism that can preach more than it learns and promise more than it delivers, and grows by holding its beliefs with the curiosity that made them worth having.`,

  'JUPITER_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and Jupiter sits in its fall here ... growth is slow, disciplined, and earned rather than given, expansion held in check by realism. Faith is cautious and rests in what has been built. Luck comes through patience and work. The shadow is the optimism kept on too tight a rein ... an instinct that can shrink hope down to what is already proven, and grows by trusting that some risks are worth taking before all the evidence is in.`,

  'JUPITER_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and Jupiter expands through the collective ... growth comes through ideals, community, and a vision aimed at the wider future. Faith rests in progress and the good of the many. Luck flows through networks and causes. The shadow is the abstraction that forgets the person ... a generosity toward humanity that can stay cool toward the individual in front of it, and grows by letting the grand vision reach the people actually nearby.`,

  'JUPITER_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and Jupiter rules its traditional home ... growth comes through compassion, faith, and a sense of the boundless larger than the self. Belief is oceanic, generous, intuitive. Luck flows through surrender and grace. The shadow is the faith that loses its footing ... an expansiveness that can dissolve into escapism and wishful drift, and grows by anchoring the boundless compassion in something real enough to act on.`,


  // ── SATURN ──
  'SATURN_Aries': `Aries is Cardinal Fire, and Saturn sits in its fall here ... the planet of restraint lands in the sign of pure impulse, and assertion becomes something effortful, earned slowly rather than felt freely. Confidence does not come for free; it gets built over years. The instinct to act meets a constant inner brake. The shadow is the courage held back ... a force that can hesitate and second guess its own initiative, and grows by learning that the boldness it lacks at the start arrives through doing, not before it.`,

  'SATURN_Taurus': `Taurus is Fixed Earth, and Saturn builds to last ... discipline expresses through patience and the slow construction of real, durable security. Mastery comes from steady work and the refusal to be hurried. There is a deep need for the ground to be solid. The shadow is the security that turns to fear of loss ... a caution that can grip what it has and refuse all risk, and grows by trusting that some things must be ventured before they can be kept.`,

  'SATURN_Gemini': `Gemini is Mutable Air, and Saturn disciplines the mind ... thinking is structured, serious, and slow to commit until it is sure. Mastery comes through rigorous study and careful speech. There can be an early fear around not knowing enough. The shadow is the mind that doubts its own voice ... an intellect that can withhold its ideas waiting to be certain, and grows by trusting that a thought worth having is worth saying before it is flawless.`,

  'SATURN_Cancer': `Cancer is Cardinal Water, and Saturn sits in its detriment here ... emotion meets a hard structure, and feeling gets guarded, managed, kept behind a wall built early. Security is sought through control rather than through trust. Warmth is real but slow to show. The shadow is the heart kept under lock ... a self that learned to armor its softness and call it strength, and grows by discovering that letting another in is not the danger it was taught to fear.`,

  'SATURN_Leo': `Leo is Fixed Fire, and Saturn sits in its detriment here ... self expression meets a heavy hand, and the urge to shine collides with a fear of being seen and found wanting. Creativity and pride must be earned rather than assumed. Praise is hard to trust. The shadow is the light kept dimmed ... a self that can hold back its own warmth and play to avoid exposure, and grows by letting the expression out before it feels fully ready, which is the only way it ripens.`,

  'SATURN_Virgo': `Virgo is Mutable Earth, and Saturn disciplines through precision ... mastery comes from method, exactness, and the patient perfecting of a craft. The instinct is diligent, exacting, quietly demanding. The shadow is the standard that can never be met ... a discipline that can turn on the self as relentless criticism, mistaking flawlessness for worth, and grows by learning that competence is real long before the work is perfect.`,

  'SATURN_Libra': `Libra is Cardinal Air, and Saturn is exalted here, at its most constructive ... discipline expresses through fairness, commitment, and the serious work of keeping a bond. Mastery comes through balance genuinely maintained and responsibility shared. The shadow is the duty that hardens into coldness ... a sense of obligation that can keep relationships correct but distant, and grows by letting warmth into the structure it so reliably upholds.`,

  'SATURN_Scorpio': `Scorpio is Fixed Water, and Saturn disciplines the depths ... control, endurance, and the mastery of intense feeling are the work here, with a will that can outlast almost anything. The instinct guards its vulnerability fiercely. The shadow is the control that becomes a prison ... a self that can armor against ever being exposed or betrayed, and grows by learning that the surrender it most fears is the thing that finally relieves the pressure of holding on.`,

  'SATURN_Sagittarius': `Sagittarius is Mutable Fire, and Saturn structures belief ... meaning gets built carefully, faith tested rather than assumed, freedom approached with a sober eye. Mastery comes through earned, examined conviction. The shadow is the doubt that fences in the search ... a caution that can shrink the horizon to what feels safe, and grows by trusting the larger view enough to commit to it and live by it.`,

  'SATURN_Capricorn': `Capricorn is Cardinal Earth, and Saturn rules here, fully itself ... discipline, ambition, and mastery are the native ground, and the life is built through patient, responsible climbing. Authority comes naturally with time. The shadow is the self that becomes only its achievements ... a structure so load bearing it forgets it is allowed to be a person, and grows by letting warmth and rest in without feeling the whole thing will collapse.`,

  'SATURN_Aquarius': `Aquarius is Fixed Air, and Saturn rules its traditional home ... discipline expresses through systems, principles, and a serious commitment to the collective and the long future. Mastery comes through structures that serve the many. The shadow is the detachment that turns rigid ... a mind that can hold its ideals so coldly it loses the human warmth they were meant to serve, and grows by letting the principle stay close to the people it is for.`,

  'SATURN_Pisces': `Pisces is Mutable Water, and Saturn structures the formless ... the work is giving shape to the intuitive, the spiritual, the boundless, building a vessel for what wants to dissolve. Mastery comes through disciplined compassion and grounded faith. The shadow is the fear of the very dissolution it lives near ... a self that can either wall off the depths or drown in them, and grows by learning to hold the formless without being lost in it.`,


  // ── URANUS ──
  'URANUS_Aries': `Uranus moves through Aries slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive impulse arrives as raw initiative, the drive to break new ground by sheer nerve. This cohort innovates by acting first and asking permission never. Freedom is taken, not requested. The shadow is revolution for its own sake ... a restlessness that can tear down simply to feel the break, and finds its better edge when the boldness builds something rather than only clearing the field.`,

  'URANUS_Taurus': `Uranus moves through Taurus slowly, and some moderns call it its fall ... the disruptor lands in the most stable sign, upending money, values, and the material ground a generation took for granted. Innovation here reshapes what people own and how they hold it. The shadow is the friction of change against deep inertia ... a cohort caught between the urge to overturn and the wish to keep, learning that even the solid has to be allowed to move.`,

  'URANUS_Gemini': `Uranus moves through Gemini slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive current runs through ideas, language, and the channels people use to talk to each other. This cohort reinvents communication and thinks in restless, original leaps. The shadow is the brilliance that scatters ... a generational mind so quick to the next idea it can struggle to settle, finding its edge when the originality lands somewhere long enough to take root.`,

  'URANUS_Cancer': `Uranus moves through Cancer slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive impulse reaches home, family, and the felt sense of belonging, unsettling what a domestic life is supposed to be. This cohort reinvents the family. The shadow is the upheaval of the very ground meant to steady ... a generation that can find security itself in flux, learning to build belonging on something freer than the old shape it broke.`,

  'URANUS_Leo': `Uranus moves through Leo slowly, and sits in its detriment ... the free, collective impulse collides with the sign of the individual ego, producing a generation that rebels in the name of personal expression. Creativity turns defiant. The shadow is the freedom that curdles into willful display ... a cohort that can mistake breaking the rules for being itself, and finds its edge when the originality serves more than the spotlight.`,

  'URANUS_Virgo': `Uranus moves through Virgo slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive current runs through work, health, and the systems that order daily life, reinventing method and craft. This cohort overhauls how things actually get done. The shadow is the innovation that frays into restlessness ... a generation that can disrupt the routine faster than it can rebuild it, finding its edge when the new method genuinely improves on the old.`,

  'URANUS_Libra': `Uranus moves through Libra slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive impulse reaches relationship, marriage, and fairness, unsettling the old contracts between people. This cohort reinvents how partnership works. The shadow is the freedom that strains the bond ... a generation pulled between independence and union, learning to build closeness that does not require giving up the self to keep it.`,

  'URANUS_Scorpio': `Uranus moves through Scorpio slowly, and some moderns note a fierce strength here ... the disruptive current dives into sex, power, death, and the hidden, dragging the buried into the open. This cohort breaks taboos. The shadow is the intensity that destabilizes ... a generation drawn to upheaval in the deep places, learning that real transformation asks for more than the thrill of breaking what was hidden.`,

  'URANUS_Sagittarius': `Uranus moves through Sagittarius slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive impulse reaches belief, religion, and the wider search, overturning inherited worldviews. This cohort reinvents what is worth believing. The shadow is the rebellion that hardens into a new dogma ... a generation that can trade one fixed creed for another, finding its edge when the freedom stays genuinely open ended.`,

  'URANUS_Capricorn': `Uranus moves through Capricorn slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive current strikes institutions, authority, and the structures that hold a society together. This cohort tears down and rebuilds the old order. The shadow is the upheaval of the very scaffolding people rely on ... a generation that can break systems faster than it replaces them, learning that some structure has to be rebuilt as well as torn out.`,

  'URANUS_Aquarius': `Uranus moves through Aquarius slowly, ruling its own ground ... the disruptive, collective impulse is fully itself, driving a generation toward technology, ideals, and reinvention of the social whole. The future arrives early here. The shadow is the cool that forgets the person ... a cohort so devoted to the system and the cause it can overlook the individual, finding its edge when the revolution stays human.`,

  'URANUS_Pisces': `Uranus moves through Pisces slowly, marking a generation ... the disruptive current reaches the spiritual and the boundless, dissolving old faiths and waking new ones. This cohort reinvents what the sacred means. The shadow is the upheaval with no firm ground ... a generation whose awakenings can blur into confusion, finding its edge when the new vision is anchored enough to act on.`,


  // ── NEPTUNE ──
  'NEPTUNE_Aries': `Neptune moves through Aries slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving, dreaming current idealizes action, courage, and the lone hero striking out. This cohort romances the bold gesture. The shadow is the dream that mistakes aggression for vision ... a generational tendency to glamorize the fight, finding its better edge when the ideal serves something past the heroism of the charge.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Taurus': `Neptune moves through Taurus slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving current reaches money, beauty, and the material, blurring the line between value and illusion. This cohort dreams through the tangible. The shadow is the fog over worth itself ... a generational confusion about what is solid and what is mirage, finding its edge when beauty and meaning are felt rather than merely consumed.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Gemini': `Neptune moves through Gemini slowly, marking a generation ... the dreaming current runs through ideas and communication, dissolving the line between information and inspiration. This cohort romances the word. The shadow is the truth that blurs in the telling ... a generational drift toward believing the compelling story over the checked fact, finding its edge when imagination serves clarity rather than clouding it.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Cancer': `Neptune moves through Cancer slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving current reaches home, family, and belonging, idealizing the past and the mother and the nation. This cohort dreams of roots. The shadow is the nostalgia that fogs the present ... a generational longing for a home that may never have existed, finding its edge when the compassion turns toward the family that actually is.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Leo': `Neptune moves through Leo slowly, marking a generation ... the dreaming current reaches romance, creativity, and glamour, idealizing the star and the grand passion. This cohort romances the spotlight. The shadow is the glamour mistaken for substance ... a generational pull toward image over heart, finding its edge when the creativity serves genuine feeling rather than only dazzle.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Virgo': `Neptune moves through Virgo slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving current reaches work, health, and the dream of perfection, often arriving as disillusion with the systems that promised it. This cohort idealizes and then doubts the useful. The shadow is the perfectionism that dissolves into despair ... a generational ache for a flawless order, finding its edge when service is offered with compassion rather than held to an impossible standard.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Libra': `Neptune moves through Libra slowly, marking a generation ... the dreaming current reaches relationship and justice, idealizing love and fairness past what people can deliver. This cohort romances the perfect union. The shadow is the partner mistaken for the dream ... a generational tendency to project the ideal onto the real, finding its edge when love is offered to the actual person rather than the fantasy.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Scorpio': `Neptune moves through Scorpio slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving current dives into sex, power, and the hidden, fascinated by the taboo and the transformative. This cohort dreams in the depths. The shadow is the allure of the abyss ... a generational pull toward intensity and escape through the forbidden, finding its edge when the depth becomes genuine transformation rather than only fascination.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Sagittarius': `Neptune moves through Sagittarius slowly, marking a generation ... the dreaming current reaches belief, travel, and the search for meaning, idealizing faith and the far horizon. This cohort romances the quest. The shadow is the faith that floats free of the ground ... a generational drift toward belief without examination, finding its edge when the spiritual longing is anchored in something lived.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Capricorn': `Neptune moves through Capricorn slowly, marking a generation ... the dissolving current reaches structures and authority, eroding faith in the institutions a society leans on. This cohort watches the old order blur. The shadow is the disillusion that turns to cynicism ... a generational loss of trust in the system, finding its edge when the dissolving makes room for something more humane to be built.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Aquarius': `Neptune moves through Aquarius slowly, marking a generation ... the dreaming current reaches technology, the collective, and the dream of a connected utopia. This cohort idealizes the network. The shadow is the utopia that dissolves the person ... a generational faith in the system that can blur the individual, finding its edge when the dream of the many keeps the human in view.`,

  'NEPTUNE_Pisces': `Neptune moves through Pisces slowly, ruling its own ground ... the dissolving, compassionate current is fully itself, opening a generation to spirituality, mysticism, and a boundless empathy. The veil is thin here. The shadow is the dissolution with no shore ... a cohort that can drift into escape and confusion, finding its edge when the boundless compassion is given a form real enough to act through.`,


  // ── PLUTO ──
  'PLUTO_Aries': `Pluto crosses Aries over a generation ... the transformative power works on the will itself, on the raw drive to assert and survive. This cohort remakes what force and selfhood mean. The shadow is power as pure aggression ... a generational pull toward domination and the violent fresh start, finding its redemption when the will to act serves renewal rather than conquest.`,

  'PLUTO_Taurus': `Pluto crosses Taurus over a generation ... the transformative power reaches money, land, and the deep structures of value, tearing down and rebuilding what is owned. This cohort remakes the meaning of wealth. The shadow is the obsession with possessing ... a generational grip on the material, finding its redemption when security is rebuilt on something that cannot be hoarded.`,

  'PLUTO_Gemini': `Pluto crosses Gemini over a generation ... the transformative power works on communication and ideas, remaking how a society thinks and speaks. This cohort overhauls the word itself. The shadow is the mind used as a weapon ... a generational pull toward manipulation and propaganda, finding its redemption when the power of language serves truth rather than control.`,

  'PLUTO_Cancer': `Pluto crosses Cancer over a generation ... the transformative power reaches home, family, and nation, dredging up buried roots and remaking belonging. This cohort transforms the family and the tribe. The shadow is the clannish grip ... a generational pull toward emotional control and the defended homeland, finding its redemption when belonging opens rather than walls off.`,

  'PLUTO_Leo': `Pluto crosses Leo over a generation ... the transformative power works on the ego, creativity, and the will to be someone. This cohort remakes the meaning of the individual. The shadow is the self that demands to dominate ... a generational pull toward the cult of personality, finding its redemption when personal power is spent on creation rather than on being obeyed.`,

  'PLUTO_Virgo': `Pluto crosses Virgo over a generation ... the transformative power reaches work, health, and the systems that order daily life, remaking labor and the body. This cohort overhauls how things function. The shadow is control disguised as improvement ... a generational pull toward perfecting and policing the practical, finding its redemption when the drive to fix becomes genuine, humane repair.`,

  'PLUTO_Libra': `Pluto crosses Libra over a generation ... the transformative power reaches relationship, marriage, and justice, remaking the contracts between people. This cohort transforms partnership itself. The shadow is the power struggle inside the bond ... a generational pull toward control in the name of fairness, finding its redemption when equality is built rather than merely demanded.`,

  'PLUTO_Scorpio': `Pluto crosses Scorpio over a generation, ruling its own ground ... the transformative power is fully itself, diving into sex, death, and the hidden machinery of power. This cohort drags the buried into the light. The shadow is the fascination with destruction ... a generational pull toward the abyss, finding its redemption when the descent becomes true regeneration rather than only ruin.`,

  'PLUTO_Sagittarius': `Pluto crosses Sagittarius over a generation ... the transformative power reaches belief, religion, and the global reach of ideas, remaking what whole cultures hold true. This cohort transforms faith and its institutions. The shadow is the conviction that turns coercive ... a generational pull toward zealotry and the export of dogma, finding its redemption when the search for truth stays genuinely open.`,

  'PLUTO_Capricorn': `Pluto crosses Capricorn over a generation ... the transformative power strikes institutions, authority, and the structures of the state, tearing down the old order to rebuild it. This cohort remakes power itself. The shadow is the abuse of the very systems it controls ... a generational pull toward authoritarian grip, finding its redemption when the rebuilt structures genuinely serve the people under them.`,

  'PLUTO_Aquarius': `Pluto crosses Aquarius over a generation ... the transformative power reaches technology, the collective, and the distribution of power among the many. This cohort remakes the social whole. The shadow is control through the network ... a generational pull toward surveillance and the tyranny of the system, finding its redemption when the power genuinely returns to the people.`,

  'PLUTO_Pisces': `Pluto crosses Pisces over a generation ... the transformative power reaches the spiritual, the unconscious, and the dissolving boundaries of the self. This cohort remakes the sacred and the collective psyche. The shadow is the descent into collective delusion ... a generational pull toward escape and dissolution, finding its redemption when the depths are faced and integrated rather than drowned in.`,


  // ── NORTH_NODE ──
  'NORTH_NODE_Aries': `The growth here runs toward selfhood ... toward independence, courage, and the nerve to want things and act on them without waiting for consensus. The South Node in Libra holds the old ease of deferring, accommodating, and defining the self through others. The pull is real but unfamiliar, because pleasing comes so naturally. The work is asking what the self actually wants first, before the automatic question of what everyone else would prefer.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Taurus': `The growth here runs toward steadiness ... toward stability, embodied presence, and a worth built on the person's own ground rather than borrowed from intensity or crisis. The South Node in Scorpio holds the old ease of upheaval, merging, and living off others' resources and dramas. The pull is toward the simple and the solid, which can feel almost too quiet at first. The work is letting security be plain and self made rather than charged and entangled.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Gemini': `The growth here runs toward curiosity ... toward listening, asking real questions, and staying open to the particular facts that complicate what is already believed. The South Node in Sagittarius holds the old ease of the sweeping conclusion and the sense of already knowing. The pull is toward the humble question rather than the grand answer. The work is gathering the details before reaching for the meaning, and letting other minds genuinely revise the view.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Cancer': `The growth here runs toward feeling ... toward vulnerability, nurture, and the courage to need and be needed rather than handling everything alone. The South Node in Capricorn holds the old ease of control, competence, and the armor of self sufficiency. The pull is toward softness, which can feel like exposure. The work is letting the guard down enough to be cared for, and trusting that to need someone is not the same as being weak.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Leo': `The growth here runs toward the heart ... toward creative courage, warmth, and the nerve to be a particular, visible individual rather than hiding in the group. The South Node in Aquarius holds the old ease of detachment and the safety of the crowd. The pull is toward being seen, which can feel dangerously exposed. The work is daring to shine as oneself, letting the warmth show instead of dissolving into the collective cool.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Virgo': `The growth here runs toward order ... toward discernment, useful work, and the dignity of showing up for the practical and the particular. The South Node in Pisces holds the old ease of drift, escape, and the formless. The pull is toward the grounded and the exact, which can feel small after the boundless. The work is bringing form to the fog, tending the daily and the concrete rather than dissolving away from it.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Libra': `The growth here runs toward partnership ... toward cooperation, fairness, and the real consideration of another person rather than charging ahead alone. The South Node in Aries holds the old ease of independence and putting the self first. The pull is toward meeting others halfway, which can feel like surrender. The work is taking the other genuinely into account, and learning to define the self through relationship rather than against it.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Scorpio': `The growth here runs toward depth ... toward transformation, shared intimacy, and the courage to let things die and change rather than clinging to comfort. The South Node in Taurus holds the old ease of stability, possession, and refusing to let go. The pull is toward intensity, which can feel like losing the solid ground. The work is allowing the deep change the comfort was built to prevent, and trusting renewal over holding on.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Sagittarius': `The growth here runs toward meaning ... toward faith, the big picture, and the courage to trust intuition over the endless gathering of data. The South Node in Gemini holds the old ease of cleverness, second guessing, and scattered detail. The pull is toward conviction, which can feel like a leap. The work is committing to a direction and a belief, letting understanding grow past mere information.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Capricorn': `The growth here runs toward responsibility ... toward maturity, self mastery, and the public contribution that comes from standing on one's own. The South Node in Cancer holds the old ease of dependence, retreat, and hiding in the familiar. The pull is toward taking charge, which can feel like too much to carry. The work is becoming one's own authority, stepping out of the shell and into a real, accountable role in the world.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Aquarius': `The growth here runs toward the collective ... toward humanitarian aims, equality, and an identity rooted in something larger than the personal spotlight. The South Node in Leo holds the old ease of ego, applause, and making it all about the self. The pull is toward serving the many, which can feel like giving up the gaze. The work is belonging to the group as an equal, spending the gifts on the whole rather than on being admired.`,

  'NORTH_NODE_Pisces': `The growth here runs toward surrender ... toward compassion, faith, and trust in a current larger than the self rather than the endless need to fix and control. The South Node in Virgo holds the old ease of criticism, management, and perfectionism. The pull is toward letting go, which can feel like losing the grip that kept things safe. The work is trading control for compassion, and trusting what cannot be managed or fully understood.`,


  // ── CHIRON ──
  'CHIRON_Aries': `The wound here gathers around the right to exist boldly ... an early sense that asserting the self, taking up space, simply being first was somehow not allowed. It can show as held back courage or as overcompensating force. The gift is the other side of the same nerve ... a hard won understanding of what it costs to claim oneself, and an uncanny ability to help others find the courage to step forward that was once so hard to feel.`,

  'CHIRON_Taurus': `The wound here gathers around worth and security ... an early sense of not having enough, not being worth enough, the ground never quite solid underfoot. It can show as anxiety about money or a struggle to feel deserving. The gift grows from the same soil ... a deep, lived understanding of how worth and security actually work, and a gift for helping others build a steady, grounded sense of their own value.`,

  'CHIRON_Gemini': `The wound here gathers around the voice and the mind ... an early sense of not being heard, not being clever enough, the words never quite landing. It can show as doubt about one's own intelligence or a fear of speaking. The gift is the healing turn of that same wound ... a real gift for language and for helping others find and trust their own voice, having known so personally what it is to feel unheard.`,

  'CHIRON_Cancer': `The wound here gathers around belonging ... an early sense of not being safely held, the nurture absent or unreliable, home a tender and uncertain place. It can show as a deep ache for security or a guarding of the soft center. The gift comes from having felt the lack ... an extraordinary capacity to nurture others and to create the belonging for them that was once so hard to find.`,

  'CHIRON_Leo': `The wound here gathers around being seen ... an early sense that the creative self, the bid for attention, the wish to shine was met with rejection or shame. It can show as a fear of the spotlight or a hunger for it. The gift is the warmth that survived the wound ... a gift for drawing out the light in others, helping them shine in the very way that once felt so unsafe.`,

  'CHIRON_Virgo': `The wound here gathers around not being good enough ... an early sense that only the flawless was acceptable, the self forever falling short of an impossible standard. It can show as harsh self criticism or anxious perfectionism. The gift is the compassion that the wound teaches ... a healer's eye for what needs mending and a gift for helping others accept themselves as whole, unfinished and worthy both.`,

  'CHIRON_Libra': `The wound here gathers around relationship ... an early sense of not being worthy of love, of being left or unchosen, the bond never quite secure. It can show as fear of rejection or a habit of over giving. The gift is born of that ache ... a deep understanding of what makes connection work, and a real capacity to help others find the love and balance once felt to be out of reach.`,

  'CHIRON_Scorpio': `The wound here gathers around power and trust ... an early experience of betrayal, loss, or powerlessness that cut to the bone. It can show as a guardedness around intimacy or a struggle with control. The gift is the depth that the wound opened ... a fearless capacity to walk with others through their darkest passages, having survived a descent of one's own.`,

  'CHIRON_Sagittarius': `The wound here gathers around meaning ... an early loss of faith, a sense that the beliefs meant to hold a life simply failed, leaving the search for truth aching. It can show as cynicism or a restless spiritual hunger. The gift comes from that very loss ... a hard won wisdom and a gift for helping others find a meaning they can actually live by.`,

  'CHIRON_Capricorn': `The wound here gathers around worth through achievement ... an early sense that only success earned acceptance, that the self mattered solely for what it produced. It can show as relentless ambition or a fear of never being enough. The gift is the structure the wound built ... a capacity to mentor and steady others, offering the recognition and solid ground once so painfully missing.`,

  'CHIRON_Aquarius': `The wound here gathers around belonging to the group ... an early sense of being the outsider, the one who never quite fit, kept at the edge of the circle. It can show as alienation or a defensive detachment. The gift grows from the outside in ... a deep empathy for the excluded and a gift for championing those who, like the self once did, stand on the margins.`,

  'CHIRON_Pisces': `The wound here gathers around boundaries and faith ... an early experience of disillusion, of suffering with no clear cause, the self too porous to the pain of the world. It can show as escapism or a sense of being lost. The gift is the compassion the wound refined ... a profound empathy and a capacity for spiritual healing, having felt so deeply what it is to suffer and to long for grace.`,

};
